		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Crow-like bird with a leather face shaped like a plague doctor's mask. Witness and record death details.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> melody, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Invisible</strong>. Turn invisible at will.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Melody</strong>. All that hear within near, WIS 12+ or fascinated while nosoi sings. Repeat check once per round; ends on success. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
